          "titulo": "Creamy Berry & Collagen Porridge",
          "notas": [
            "COOK THE BASE: Combine the 15g oat bran, 15g Scottish porridge oats, and 300ml Gold Top milk in a microwave-safe bowl or small saucepan. Heat on high for 2 minutes (or simmer on the stove for 3–4 minutes), stirring halfway through until thick and creamy.",
